chool that boasted the largest number top disciples in the koto music world, her own skills are second to none. As emotional support, she cherishes a diary about Kagurahara Girls Academy that she found when she was young. She is the spitting image of the “sister” that appears in Suzu’s dreams."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c89618"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/05/0577df9da0ac96e0a643b7cc51a03d59b1e8be226f360f34fb785185e3c38209.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/95/952eba21a36da5498c8d89c9448b310dd813fa8879b46f1b341cce66fbd00690.webp","width":256,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"望月舞衣","creatorId":"vndb:s20866","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s20866","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s20866","name":"望月舞衣","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:84365","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c89619","characterName":"青柳 真弥","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c89619"},"originalCharacterName":"青柳 真弥","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Suzu’s childhood friend who is usually reliable, but occasionally messes up. She loves Suzu and cherishes her above all else. Not only did she go attend this school because of Suzu, she also started playing koto music because of her. She is good at making sweets, but is also very timid and easily gets scared."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c89619"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/1a/1ad5572fb2633310aac989fbfe75f8fc604992856da8528a1dbf0de0ea7af948.webp","fallbackUrl":